      <p begin="01:09.620" end="01:11.970" ttm:agent="v1">I walk in, walked out with the safe</p>

      <p begin="01:11.970" end="01:14.070" ttm:agent="v1">Mando, let me know what the play</p>

      <p begin="01:14.070" end="01:18.860" ttm:agent="v1">Squabble up, squabble up, squabble up, squabble up</p>

