      <p begin="01:55.530" end="01:57.800" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch with him and some bitch in him, that's a lot of bitch</p>

      <p begin="01:57.800" end="02:00.100" ttm:agent="v1">Don't hit 'em, he got kids with him, my apologies</p>

